E2fsprogs 1.41.14 has released, and I've merged the last-minute fixes
into the master/next development branches.  From here on out, except for
severe bugs that have to be fixed urgently, the primary focus of
development will be on the master/next branches, which will be
targetting a 1.42 release.

In some cases "next" may be ahead of "master" if there are changes that
need some "baking" before they are safe for casual users (who are
willing to build from source :-) to try and use.

